## Team Coordination Rules

1. **Check HANDOFF.md first.** At the start of every session, read `projects/[active-project]/HANDOFF.md` before anything else. If a row exists addressed to your role with status ⏳ Pending, that is your work.
2. All agents read `active-project.md` before starting any session.
3. Work only on the active project unless the PM explicitly changes it.
4. Handoffs require three elements: (a) deliverable artifact, (b) updated `status.md`, (c) new row in `HANDOFF.md`.
5. **Never skip the handoff.** Writing to HANDOFF.md is what activates the next agent. Without it, the team stalls.
6. Blocked milestones are marked BLOCKED in `status.md` and require human input before resuming.
7. No agent may modify another agent's primary output files without explicit coordination.
8. In overnight mode: implement milestones, run tests, fix bugs only. No architecture changes.

